{"963": {"data": {"tag_id": 963, "tag_name": "奥特曼", "cover": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/tag/0f84368a89745bdbe5dd75bf1e7a5a17cc4ac8e2.jpg", "head_cover": "", "content": "奥特曼（Ultraman 日：ウルトラマン）是日本圆谷株式会社拍摄的科学空想特摄电视连续剧，由杂志连载、电影、电视剧变成节目演变出现。奥特曼在普通人眼中是高大的巨人，就如同神一般的存在，可是他们对于自己的种族，自己的星球来说也只不过是一个普通人。超进化给他们带来了完善的生命形态，同时也使他们背负起了沉重的历史责任，在这种历史责任感驱使下，光之巨人的足迹遍步宇宙，而其中有这么几位巨人，他们来到了我们所在的地球，邂逅了宇宙中最奇妙也是最难以捉摸的生命体—人类。", "short_content": "", "type": 3, "state": 0, "ctime": 1436866637, "count": {"view": 0, "use": 0, "atten": 0}, "is_atten": 0, "likes": 0, "hates": 0, "attribute": 0, "liked": 0, "hated": 0, "extra_attr": 0}, "day_count": 1}, "24090": {"data": {"tag_id": 24090, "tag_name": "怪兽", "cover": "", "head_cover": "", "content": "", "short_content": "", "type": 3, "state": 0, "ctime": 1436866637, "count": {"view": 0, "use": 0, "atten": 0}, "is_atten": 0, "likes": 0, "hates": 0, "attribute": 0, "liked": 0, "hated": 0, "extra_attr": 0}, "day_count": 1}, "68": {"data": {"tag_id": 68, "tag_name": "鬼畜", "cover": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/5f42290e9299eceb7dfce4b932b497d1255ea847.jpg", "head_cover": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/af941ccd50c12c1ccd91869bfcc6fb22d71b458f.png", "content": "起源于NICONICO动画，由最早出现的音MAD《最终鬼畜妹フランドール・S》中的“鬼畜”略称而得名。", "short_content": "以音频调教创作为主体的二次创作", "type": 3, "state": 0, "ctime": 1436866637, "count": {"view": 0, "use": 0, "atten": 0}, "is_atten": 0, "likes": 0, "hates": 0, "attribute": 0, "liked": 0, "hated": 0, "extra_attr": 0}, "day_count": 1}, "2947": {"data": {"tag_id": 2947, "tag_name": "特摄", "cover": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/11d6f73281947ac0d0371897241ad9ef5530b6b6.jpg", "head_cover": "", "content": "", "short_content": "", "type": 3, "state": 0, "ctime": 1436866637, "count": {"view": 0, "use": 0, "atten": 0}, "is_atten": 0, "likes": 0, "hates": 0, "attribute": 0, "liked": 0, "hated": 0, "extra_attr": 0}, "day_count": 2}, "1411": {"data": {"tag_id": 1411, "tag_name": "童年", "cover": "", "head_cover": "", "content": "", "short_content": "", "type": 3, "state": 0, "ctime": 1436866637, "count": {"view": 0, "use": 0, "atten": 0}, "is_atten": 0, "likes": 0, "hates": 0, "attribute": 0, "liked": 0, "hated": 0, "extra_attr": 0}, "day_count": 1}, "1833": {"data": {"tag_id": 1833, "tag_name": "搞笑", "cover": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/4afb90b88597f226d22fdaed28a5c4769b372fdc.png", "head_cover": "", "content": "一起进来每日补充沙雕能量", "short_content": "今天你笑出声了吗？", "type": 3, "state": 0, "ctime": 1436866637, "count": {"view": 0, "use": 0, "atten": 0}, "is_atten": 0, "likes": 0, "hates": 0, "attribute": 0, "liked": 0, "hated": 0, "extra_attr": 0}, "day_count": 5}, "91925701": {"data": {"tag_id": 91925701, "tag_name": "updream", "cover": "", "head_cover": "", "content": "", "short_content": "", "type": 1, "state": 0, "ctime": 1774664184, "count": {"view": 0, "use": 0, "atten": 0}, "is_atten": 0, "likes": 0, "hates": 0, "attribute": 0, "liked": 0, "hated": 0, "extra_attr": 0}, "day_count": 4}, "99794924": {"data": {"tag_id": 99794924, "tag_name": "MiniMaxH3整活", "cover": "", "head_cover": "", "content": "", "short_content": "", "type": 1, "state": 0, "ctime": 1786539091, "count": {"view": 0, "use": 0, "atten": 0}, "is_atten": 0, "likes": 0, "hates": 0, "attribute": 0, "liked": 0, "hated": 0, "extra_attr": 0}, "day_count": 1}, "7429645": {"data": {"tag_id": 7429645, "tag_name": "AI生成", "cover": "", "head_cover": "", "content": "", "short_content": "", "type": 0, "state": 0, "ctime": 1528807599, "count": {"view": 0, "use": 0, "atten": 0}, "is_atten": 0, "likes": 0, "hates": 0, "attribute": 0, "liked": 0, "hated": 0, "extra_attr": 0}, "day_count": 1}, "96162812": {"data": {"tag_id": 96162812, "tag_name": "AI整活全宇宙", "cover": "", "head_cover": "", "content": "", "short_content": "", "type": 0, "state": 0, "ctime": 1781025406, "count": {"view": 0, "use": 0, "atten": 0}, "is_atten": 0, "likes": 0, "hates": 0, "attribute": 0, "liked": 0, "hated": 0, "extra_attr": 0}, "day_count": 1}, "1394": {"data": {"tag_id": 1394, "tag_name": "动漫", "cover": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/tag/d08c5fe17ceb793e7ce95d9c67392743b33b46d0.jpg", "head_cover": "", "content": "      “动漫”是动画和漫画的合称与缩写。在其他语言相当少用。随着现代传媒技术的发展，动画（animation或anime）和漫画（comics，manga；特别是故事性漫画）之间联系日趋紧密，两者常被合而为“动漫”。\n　   由于漫画本身的发展形成了现代故事漫画的表现形式，将影视艺术融入漫画之中，使得漫画与动画更容易结合，影视艺术独特的地方在于它能通过镜头的推拉摇移和片段剪辑的蒙太奇技巧来表达想法和感受。漫画正是吸收了影视艺术的这两个特点。当讲述的故事越发复杂、人物越发丰富的时候，传统单线式叙事的方法就越行不通，蒙太奇的介入就成为一种需要了；当漫画家在传统表现手段中无法找到更合适的抒发感情的方法的时候，当读者需要作品有更强的冲击力和表现力的时候，各种镜头的灵活运用就成为一种必需了。一部现代故事漫画往往集远、中、近、特四种镜头于一身，漫画家往往能熟练地运用镜头的移动和各种蒙太奇剪接，对故事特定部分的情绪和氛围进行渲染。这就是现代故事漫画容易和动画结合的一个原因，因为它天生就像动画的分镜头剧本，读者在看漫画时如同在看一部电影。正是有着这样的相似性所以如今将动画和漫画合称为“动漫”。", "short_content": "", "type": 3, "state": 0, "ctime": 1436866637, "count": {"view": 0, "use": 0, "atten": 0}, "is_atten": 0, "likes": 0, "hates": 0, "attribute": 0, "liked": 0, "hated": 0, "extra_attr": 0}, "day_count": 1}, "3939": {"data": {"tag_id": 3939, "tag_name": "火影忍者", "cover": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/tag/2ffe139868ac38f160e3e8161048322b1e9eb617.jpg", "head_cover": "", "content": "《火影忍者》是日本漫画家岸本齐史的代表作，作品于1999年开始在周刊《少年JUMP》上连载。故事成功地将原本隐藏在黑暗中，用世界上最强大的毅力和最艰辛的努力去做最密不可宣和隐讳残酷的事情的忍者，描绘成了太阳下最值得骄傲最光明无限的的职业。在这个忍者的世界中，每一位年轻的主人翁都在开拓着属于自己的忍道。", "short_content": "", "type": 3, "state": 0, "ctime": 1436866637, "count": {"view": 0, "use": 0, "atten": 0}, "is_atten": 0, "likes": 0, "hates": 0, "attribute": 0, "liked": 0, "hated": 0, "extra_attr": 1}, "day_count": 1}, "1907": {"data": {"tag_id": 1907, "tag_name": "二次元", "cover": "", "head_cover": "", "content": "", "short_content": "", "type": 3, "state": 0, "ctime": 1436866637, "count": {"view": 0, "use": 0, "atten": 0}, "is_atten": 0, "likes": 0, "hates": 0, "attribute": 0, "liked": 0, "hated": 0, "extra_attr": 1}, "day_count": 1}, "17095037": {"data": {"tag_id": 17095037, "tag_name": "宿傩", "cover": "", "head_cover": "", "content": "", "short_content": "", "type": 1, "state": 0, "ctime": 1603481079, "count": {"view": 0, "use": 0, "atten": 0}, "is_atten": 0, "likes": 0, "hates": 0, "attribute": 0, "liked": 0, "hate